;(function() D("SeviathsUsefulToolsDB","learnedQuests",{[91733]={["y"]=71.9086,["x"]=76.4946,["o"]="collect the waterlogged axe, waterlogged saw, and waterlogged toolbox that have washed downstream from eastvale logging camp, then return to ormin pelford. i was bringing back a supply shipment from the trading post, but my wagon tipped over and the supplies fell in the river! before i could catch them, they had already washed downstream.\n\nbetween the murlocs and wolves down there, i don't stand a chance of retrieving the supplies on my own. you seem like the hardy sort. do you think you could find them for me?",["m"]=1429,["l"]=10,["g"]="Ormin Pelford",["t"]="Downstream"},[91741]={["y"]=36.2293,["x"]=49.2541,["g"]="Nibbled-On Book",["m"]=1429,["l"]=2,["o"]="return the book to brother paxton. <one of the kobolds dropped this book. it looks like the kobold might have tried to eat it.\n\nbrother paxton inside the abbey has a small library he maintains. the book must have come from there.>",["t"]="Nibbled-On Book"},[33]={["y"]=40.0931,["x"]=48.8999,["g"]="Eagan Peltskinner",["m"]=1429,["t"]="Wolves Across the Border",["o"]="bring 8 pieces of tough wolf meat to eagan peltskinner outside northshire abbey. i hate those nasty timber wolves!  but i sure like eating wolf steaks...  bring me tough wolf meat and i will exchange it for something you'll find useful.\n\ntough wolf meat is gathered from hunting the timber wolves and young wolves wandering the northshire countryside.",["l"]=2},[35]={["y"]=65.942,["x"]=42.1556,["g"]="Marshal Dughan",["m"]=1429,["t"]="Further Concerns",["o"]="marshal dughan wants you to speak with guard thomas. if you are concerned that the rumors of murlocs are true, then do this -- travel to the eastern elwynn bridge and speak with guard thomas.  he has been stationed at the bridge for the past week and will know the state of the area.\n\nbring me his report.",["l"]=10},[92742]={["y"]=53.0367,["x"]=52.4976,["o"]="use the well water sample kit to collect samples from the wells at the jansen stead and the molsen farm. we must determine the source and nature of the poison corrupting this land. let us begin with the groundwater under the farms in the area.\n\ngo to the jansen stead in the north and the molsen farm northwest of here, and collect samples from the wells there.",["m"]=1436,["l"]=12,["g"]="Alba Fairmoon",["t"]="Testing the Wells"},[37]={["y"]=72.1401,["x"]=73.8884,["o"]="kill 8 prowlers and 5 young forest bears, and then return to guard thomas at the east elwynn bridge. hail, vydelin.  wild animals are growing more and more aggressive the farther we get from goldshire, and the eastvale logging camp suffers nearly constant attacks from wolves and bears!\n\nwe could use your help out here.",["m"]=1429,["l"]=10,["g"]="Guard Thomas",["t"]="Find the Lost Guards"},[91758]={["y"]=41.623,["x"]=48.9081,["l"]=4,["m"]=1429,["t"]="Follow That Kobold!",["o"]="speak to tordrin sternblade near the stable behind northshire's abbey. you're not done with those kobolds yet. we just got word from kelsey that a kobold left the mine carrying a large sack of books. i need you to track down this kobold so we can retrieve the books for brother paxton.\n\ngo talk to tordrin sternblade. he's the new hunter trainer that just arrived from ironforge. you can find him behind the abbey, near the stable. he can help you track this kobold thief.",["g"]="Marshal McBride"},[40]={["y"]=67.149,["x"]=42.125,["g"]="Remy \"Two Times\"",["m"]=1429,["t"]="A Fishy Peril",["o"]="remy \"two times\" wants you to speak with marshal dughan in goldshire. vanessa, there's a new threat in elwynn forest!  murlocs are swimming up the streams of eastern elwynn, scaring away fish and attacking gentle folk!\n\ni warned marshal dughan, but he's more worried about the gnolls and the bandits.  he's not convinced that the murlocs are a danger.\n\nplease, vanessa, speak to dughan and persuade him to send more troops to the east!",["l"]=10},[97894]={["y"]=34.1688,["x"]=59.5259,["o"]="check on gorbold steelhand in auberdine in darkshore.\n\nborgus mentioned a boat on the southern-most dock in stormwind harbor that can take you there. pleasure to make yer acquaintance! name's borgus, of the one and only steelhand family. you can always count on a steelhand fer a fair deal!\n\na few weeks back me brother gorbold joined up with a merchant stall in auberdine. plenty of coin to be made supplyin' ships there, let me tell you! lucky sod.\n\ni haven't heard from him since--mind checking on him if yer heading that way?\n\nthere's a new ship in the harbor that will take ye straight there. head to the southern-most dock; can't miss it!",["m"]=1453,["l"]=17,["g"]="Borgus Steelhand",["t"]="Business in Auberdine"},[783]={["y"]=42.9117,["x"]=48.0999,["g"]="Deputy Willem",["m"]=1429,["t"]="A Threat Within",["o"]="speak with marshal mcbride. i hope you strapped your belt on tight, young warlock, because there is work to do here in northshire.\n\nand i don't mean farming.\n\nthe stormwind guards are hard pressed to keep the peace here, with so many of us in distant lands and so many threats pressing close.  and so we're enlisting the aid of anyone willing to defend their home.  and their alliance.\n\nif you're here to answer the call, then speak with my superior, marshal mcbride.  he's inside the abbey behind me.",["l"]=1},[45]={["y"]=60.2499,["x"]=72.6676,["l"]=10,["m"]=1429,["t"]="Discover Rolf's Fate",["o"]="search the murloc village for rolf, or signs of his death. upon further searching the area, you find webbed footprints leading east along the shore of stone cairn lake.  in the distance to the east, you can just barely see a murloc village.\n\nperhaps rolf's fate ended there...",["g"]="A half-eaten body"},[92124]={["y"]=40.4629,["x"]=49.6019,["l"]=2,["m"]=1429,["t"]="Book Inventory",["g"]="Brother Paxton",["o"]="speak to daniel, brother paxton's assistant in the library. we need to take stock of how many books are missing!\n\ngo talk to my useless assistant, daniel. he can do a quick inventory and let us know how serious the problem is.\n\nhe's obsessed with the various trade professions in elwynn forest. the boy keeps focusing on those instead of his important work helping me.\n\ndon't let him prattle on about tradeskills, and find out what's happened to my books!"},[46]={["y"]=72.2016,["x"]=73.9096,["l"]=10,["m"]=1429,["t"]="Bounty on Murlocs",["g"]="Guard Thomas",["o"]="bring 8 torn murloc fins to guard thomas at the east elwynn bridge. the stormwind army has placed a bounty on murloc lurkers and foragers in elwynn.  slaughter them and bring me their torn murloc fins, and the stormwind army will reward you well.\n\nthe murlocs have built a village at stone cairn lake north of here, and another to the south where the stream forks."},[47]={["y"]=67.2046,["x"]=42.1286,["l"]=7,["m"]=1429,["t"]="Gold Dust Exchange",["o"]="bring 10 gold dust to remy \"two times\" in goldshire.  gold dust is gathered from kobolds in elwynn forest. the kobolds in these parts sometimes carry gold dust on them.  i could really use the stuff - bring me a load of it and i'll give you the best price in town...best price in town!\n\nyou can find kobolds in the fargodeep mine to the south, and around the jasperlode mine to the northeast.",["g"]="Remy \"Two Times\""},[91775]={["y"]=65.8909,["x"]=42.1954,["l"]=6,["m"]=1429,["t"]="Book Return",["o"]="find 6 lost books and \"fun with elementals\" and return them to marshal dughan. while you're investigating the fargodeep mine, see if you can find any of brother paxton's books to return. in particular, paxton is very concerned about a book titled, \"fun with elementals\". he thinks even a kobold could use it to summon an elemental servant. be warned, the depths of the mine are fairly dangerous. you should bring friends.\n\ntake this book bag to protect the books when you find them!",["g"]="Marshal Dughan"},[95998]={["y"]=63.2421,["x"]=44.9818,["g"]="Sam Sarsaparilla",["m"]=1429,["t"]="The Great Outdoors",["o"]="sit near sam's basic campfire and wait until you receive the boosted rest buff. well howdy there, warlock. i can see you've got the look of an adventurer about you. good for you. the world needs more of us restless souls, seeking fortune and glory.\n\nit's a big wide world out there and you'll need to learn to thrive in the wilds to be successful. not sure how your outdoorsman skills are but i reckon i could teach you a thing or two, if you'd be apt to learn.\n\nhave a seat near the fire, get comfy. i'll walk you through it.",["l"]=6},[3105]={["y"]=41.622,["x"]=48.8689,["l"]=1,["m"]=1429,["t"]="Tainted Letter",["g"]="Marshal McBride",["o"]="read the tainted letter and speak to drusilla la salle next to northshire abbey. i was asked to bring this to your attention as soon as you returned from the kobold camps, vanessa. it appears to be a letter sealed with the insignia of drusilla, one of our local trainers. i wouldn't hesitate to read it before you go about any other business here in the abbey."},[92744]={["y"]=53.0367,["x"]=52.4976,["o"]="alba fairmoon wants you to collect 7 longshore murloc gills along the shoreline of westfall. the corruption affecting westfall's crops may have seeped into the ocean as well. if the local fish are affected too, it could doom stormwind to famine.\ncollect gills from the murlocs along the shoreline and bring them to me. murlocs are quite hardy, but their physiology is extremely sensitive to contaminants. any toxins in the seawater will be readily apparent in the gills you find.",["m"]=1436,["l"]=12,["g"]="Alba Fairmoon",["t"]="Murloc Gills"},[91752]={["y"]=32.2923,["x"]=47.1836,["l"]=3,["m"]=1429,["t"]="The Big Picture",["g"]="Kelsey Fargo",["o"]="retrieve a sack of \"picture\" books from shinyfinder narf. bring the sack to marshal mcbride just inside northshire's abbey. every once in a while, a kobold comes through yelling \"picture for narf!\" i don't know who narf is. maybe one of the head kobolds at the back of the mine? i bet he has a whole sack of books by now.\n\ngo get those books and bring them to our local law enforcement, marshal mcbride. you should find a friend to help. those kobolds inside the mine are a lot meaner."},[96626]={["y"]=63.3094,["x"]=44.8439,["g"]="Sam Sarsaparilla",["m"]=1429,["t"]="Camping 101: Cooking",["o"]="speak with tomas in goldshire to learn to become a cook. so you want to learn more about camping, huh? good for you, warlock. the first step any adventurer needs to take is to become a cook and learn how to make a campfire.\n\ncooking's not just about making tasty foods. it's also the foundation for your camp.",["l"]=6},[458]={["y"]=42.531,["x"]=59.9025,["t"]="The Woodland Protector",["m"]=1438,["l"]=1,["g"]="Melithar Staghelm",["o"]="seek out the dryad known as tarindrella. thank goodness you are here, warlock. strange news has traveled to me through the whisperings of the forest spirits.\n\nthe mysterious woodland protector, tarindrella, has returned to shadowglen. the dryad's presence has not been felt in the forests of kalimdor in years. something is surely amiss if she has journeyed back to this land.\n\nseek out tarindrella and see what business she tends to in our grove. one of the sentinels reported seeing her to the southwest of aldrassil."},[97920]={["y"]=63.3012,["x"]=44.9605,["g"]="Sam Sarsaparilla",["m"]=1429,["t"]="Camping 101: Fishing",["o"]="speak with lee brown near goldshire to learn to craft a camping item for your profession once you have shown proficiency in your skill. you might not think so, but your skill as a fisherman can actually come in handy at camp.\n\ni reckon i know someone that can teach you how to craft a fish bowl for your camp. you can use this fixture to help provide a bit of joy to yourself and your fellow adventurers. a happy adventurer is a strong adventurer and i'm sure your combat capabilities will reflect that.",["l"]=6},[59]={["y"]=65.9913,["x"]=42.137,["t"]="Cloth and Leather Armor",["m"]=1429,["l"]=10,["o"]="give sara timberlain the stormwind armor marker. for your shrewdness and valor, i have a marker here that is good for one piece of armor.  i want you to take it to sara timberlain at the eastvale logging camp.  give her the marker, and she will fashion the armor for you.  and after you receive it, vydelin, use it in the defense of elwynn.\n\nthe eastvale logging camp is beyond guard thomas' post to the east.",["g"]="Marshal Dughan"},[15]={["y"]=41.622,["x"]=48.8689,["l"]=3,["m"]=1429,["t"]="Investigate Echo Ridge",["g"]="Marshal McBride",["o"]="kill 10 kobold workers, then report back to marshal mcbride. vanessa, my scouts tell me that the kobold infestation is larger than we had thought.  a group of kobold workers has camped near the echo ridge mine to the north.\n\ngo to the mine and remove them.  we know there are at least 10.  kill them, see if there are more, then report back to me."},[60]={["y"]=65.7064,["x"]=43.3359,["l"]=7,["m"]=1429,["t"]="Kobold Candles",["o"]="bring 8 large candles to william pestle in goldshire. hello, my lady!  do you have a moment?\n\nmy brother and i run an apothecary in stormwind, and i'm here to gather large candles for their wax.  can you help me?\n\nyou can get large candles from kobolds, and i hear rumors that kobolds are infesting the elwynn mines ... the fargodeep mine to the south and jasperlode mine to the east.  i suggest looking for candles in one of those places.",["g"]="William Pestle"},[1642]={["y"]=51.5633,["x"]=53.3307,["l"]=12,["m"]=1453,["t"]="The Tome of Divinity",["o"]="speak to duthorian rall in stormwind. in all things, a paladin must reflect the light which supplements our strength. to strive to be divine for one of our kind does not mean we strive for godhood--we strive to be good in all actions.\n\nalthough called upon to smite evil in these harsh times, you must always remember that it's aiding others that will truly set you apart from the citizens of azeroth. compassion, patience, bravery--these things mean as much to a paladin as strength in battle.\n\nknow this well, and never forget it.",["g"]="Tome of Divinity"},[61]={["y"]=65.7942,["x"]=43.3396,["g"]="William Pestle",["m"]=1429,["t"]="Shipment to Stormwind",["o"]="bring william's shipment to morgan pestle in the stormwind trade district. my brother morgan is waiting in stormwind for my shipment of candles.  i don't have enough time to make the trip myself, but if you'd like to take him the shipment, he'll pay you well.\n\ni've packed up the candles, and you can find morgan in our shop, pestle's apothecary, in the stormwind trade district.",["l"]=7},[91745]={["y"]=40.4247,["x"]=49.5469,["g"]="Brother Paxton",["m"]=1429,["l"]=3,["o"]="talk to kelsey fargo outside the echo ridge mine in northshire valley. go talk to the new mining apprentice, kelsey fargo. she works right outside the mine and has probably seen what the kobolds are up to. maybe she can teach you a thing or two about mining while you're at it.",["t"]="Mining Consultant"},[62]={["y"]=65.9079,["x"]=42.1521,["g"]="Marshal Dughan",["m"]=1429,["t"]="The Fargodeep Mine",["o"]="explore the fargodeep mine, then return to marshal dughan in goldshire. the mine in northshire isn't the only one with problems!  i have reports that the fargodeep mine in elwynn has also become a haven for kobolds.\n\nexplore the mine and confirm these reports, then return to me.  the mine is almost due south of goldshire, between the stonefield and maclure homesteads.",["l"]=7},[3904]={["y"]=39.3031,["x"]=50.6199,["g"]="Milly Osworth",["m"]=1429,["l"]=4,["o"]="bring 8 crates of milly's harvest to milly osworth at northshire abbey. a gang of brigands, the defias, moved into the northshire vineyards while i was harvesting!  i reported it to the northshire guards and they assured me they'd take care of things, but... i'm afraid for my crop of grapes!  if the defias don't steal them then i fear our guards will trample them when they chase away the thugs.\n\nplease, you must help me!  i gathered most of my grapes into buckets, but i left them in the vineyards to the southeast.\n\nbring me those crates!  save my harvest!",["t"]="Milly's Harvest"},[2158]={["y"]=47.792,["x"]=45.656,["g"]="Falkhaan Isenstrider",["m"]=1429,["t"]="Rest and Relaxation",["o"]="speak with innkeeper farley at the lion's pride inn. every adventurer should rest when exhaustion sets in - and there is no finer place to get rest and relaxation than at the lion's pride inn!\n\nmy best friend, innkeeper farley, runs the lion's pride. if you tell him i sent you, he may give you the special discounted rates on food and drink.\n\nto find the lion's pride inn, travel south along the road from here -- you can't miss it!",["l"]=5},[99143]={["y"]=62.3197,["x"]=47.5445,["g"]="Lee Brown",["m"]=1429,["t"]="Bottles and Baubles",["o"]="collect 6 pieces of shiny junk from the nearby murloc camp. those fish men must think like actual fish, right? which means anything they like, fish will like!\n\nif you rummage through some of their junk and return to me with anything that seems like it would make good bait, i'll reward you.",["l"]=7},[1643]={["y"]=47.5944,["x"]=50.6449,["l"]=12,["m"]=1453,["t"]="The Tome of Divinity",["o"]="search the trade district of stormwind for stephanie turner. your task then, vydelin, is to find someone here in stormwind that is in need of aid. someone who is pure of heart and motive. perhaps someone helping others. perhaps someone in need of a guide. regardless, the person must have noble intent and be relying on your kindness.\n\ndo this, and return to me when you are finished. then, we shall discuss more of your path and what it means to be a paladin of the light.",["g"]="Duthorian Rall"},[96627]={["y"]=41.623,["x"]=48.9081,["g"]="Marshal McBride",["m"]=1429,["t"]="The Adventurer",["o"]="speak to sam sarsparilla near goldshire. vanessa, you have proven your competence as a protector thus far. that is why i am now entrusting you with an unusual task.\n\ni've heard of a new adventurer down the road by goldshire. go and see what he's doing.",["l"]=6},[399]={["y"]=47.8573,["x"]=57.5845,["t"]="Humble Beginnings",["m"]=1453,["l"]=15,["o"]="go to baros alexston's house in westfall and search for his compass, then return it to him in cathedral square of stormwind. it seems an eternity since i was a boy working the farm in westfall. they say you can never go back, and it's true. doubly true in my case, my family's home has been burned down and taken over by thieves.\n\ni have spoken with my father about the fate of some of my possessions, including my first compass. he was unable to save them. however, he also says that they should be hidden away on the farm.\n\nyou'll find the alexston farmstead west of sentinel hill. perhaps you could go and retrieve it for me?",["g"]="Baros Alexston"},[71]={["y"]=55.5903,["x"]=79.7861,["m"]=1429,["g"]="Rolf's corpse",["o"]="deliver rolf and malakai's medallions to guard thomas at the eastern elwynn bridge. now that you have both medallions, deliver them to guard thomas at the bridge so that he might know the fate of his murdered guards."},[1644]={["y"]=72.2668,["x"]=63.7213,["t"]="The Tome of Divinity",["m"]=1453,["l"]=13,["g"]="Stephanie Turner",["o"]="bring 10 linen cloth to stephanie turner in stormwind. bless their hearts, most of them have no families because of the scourge attacks in the last decade.\n\nmy husband john collects the materials for me to make the shirts and pants for the children, but i haven't even had time to do that. i've been too focused on keeping food on their plates, and a roof over their heads.\n\nwhat's that? you'd be willing to help? oh, thank the light, and thank you, vydelin.\n\nif you could bring me some linen cloth so i can sew clothes for the kids, that would help me out so much."},[76]={["y"]=65.8332,["x"]=42.1743,["m"]=1429,["l"]=10,["g"]="Marshal Dughan",["t"]="The Jasperlode Mine"},[99128]={["y"]=62.2679,["x"]=47.5134,["l"]=7,["m"]=1429,["t"]="Slimy Menace",["o"]="kill 7 murlocs and 4 murloc streamrunner at crystal lake, then return to jason mathers. this can only be the work of those murlocs on the other side of the lake. they're disgusting little things, with a vicious temper and teeth to match. \n\nif we let this continue, there won't be any fish to speak of anywhere in this lake. if you could clear them out a bit, it would help me a ton.",["g"]="Jason Mathers"},[83]={["y"]=68.7678,["x"]=79.5017,["o"]="bring 6 red linen bandanas to sara timberlain at the eastvale logging camp. the defias gang in northshire wears burlap masks, but the defias in elwynn wear linen which i can use to make fine linen goods.\n\nbring me red linen bandanas and i'll use them to fashion something for you.\n\ndefias gang members have camps pocketed throughout elwynn.",["m"]=1429,["l"]=9,["g"]="Sara Timberlain",["t"]="Red Linen Goods"},[84]={["y"]=84.2805,["x"]=34.5143,["o"]="bring the pork belly pie to billy maclure at the maclure vineyards. here you go.  and when you give this pie to that billy, you tell him i hope he chokes on it!",["m"]=1429,["l"]=6,["g"]="\"Auntie\" Bernice Stonefield",["t"]="Back to Billy"},[85]={["y"]=84.3221,["x"]=34.5532,["m"]=1429,["l"]=6,["g"]="\"Auntie\" Bernice Stonefield",["t"]="Lost Necklace"},[86]={["y"]=85.6738,["x"]=43.0949,["g"]="Billy Maclure",["m"]=1429,["t"]="Pie for Billy",["o"]="bring 4 chunks of boar meat to auntie bernice stonefield at the stonefield's farm. maybe if i got a pie, i could tell you who has that necklace.  and you know, i think that old bernice lady at that other farm makes great pork belly pies... \n\nmaybe if you gave her some chunks of boar meat from the boars that hang around our farms, and told her what it was for, she'd bake up a pie for you.",["l"]=6},[87]={["y"]=85.7745,["x"]=43.0574,["l"]=8,["m"]=1429,["t"]="Goldtooth",["g"]="Billy Maclure",["o"]="bring bernice's necklace to \"auntie\" bernice stonefield at the stonefield farm. i was playing near the fargodeep mine, and i think i dropped, er...i mean i saw, the old lady's necklace.  don't ask me how it got there...it wasn't me!\n\nwell anyway, i saw this big, gold-toothed kobold pick up the necklace and run into the mine.  go find that kobold and you'll find the necklace, i swear!"},[88]={["y"]=84.5063,["x"]=34.7345,["m"]=1429,["l"]=9,["g"]="Ma Stonefield",["t"]="Princess Must Die!"},[91772]={["y"]=40.932,["x"]=51.2453,["l"]=4,["m"]=1429,["t"]="Shhh! We're Hunting Kobolds",["o"]="follow the kobold tracks and report to marshal dughan in goldshire with your findings and the kobold tracking kit. alright. take this kobold tracking kit. it'll let ye' track the kobold that marshal mcbride is concerned with.\n\nfollow the tracks and bring what ye' find to marshal dughan in goldshire.\n\ni have a feelin' these varmints are up to somethin' outside northshire. so ye'll be needin' dughan's help.",["g"]="Tordrin Sternblade"},[153]={["y"]=52.8532,["x"]=53.9505,["o"]="bring 15 red leather bandanas to scout galiaan at sentinel hill. the defias front is constantly shifting.  i've been following their movements for quite some time now.  on a side note, i've ascertained that many members of the gang can be tracked by the red leather bandanas they wear.\n\nbring me 15 of these bandanas and i'll see to it you are rewarded.",["m"]=1436,["l"]=15,["g"]="Scout Galiaan",["t"]="Red Leather Bandanas"},[1598]={["y"]=42.7187,["x"]=49.8329,["o"]="retrieve the powers of the void for drusilla la salle. you there! vanessa, right?\n\ni hope you're sure about becoming a warlock, because if you can't hold your own, you're likely to get pulled under.\n\ni'm to teach you, but i need to make sure you're strong enough first.\n\nthere was a novice studying at the abbey who ran off to join the defias brotherhood. why do i care? well, he stole some important books.\n\none of those happens to be a book i've wanted for myself, the powers of the void. steal it for me, they have it hidden at their tent in the vineyards.",["m"]=1429,["l"]=4,["g"]="Drusilla La Salle",["t"]="The Stolen Tome"},[99129]={["y"]=62.1111,["x"]=47.4043,["l"]=7,["m"]=1429,["t"]="A Man About a Murloc",["o"]="speak with remy \"two times\" about jason's murloc problems. remy mentioned murlocs the other day... i'm pretty sure he hates the little buggers as much as i do. \n\nhe might have some ideas on how to keep them away from my fish in the future. i'd like to ask you to go chat with him and see if there's anything he can think of.",["g"]="Jason Mathers"},[6]={["y"]=42.9146,["x"]=48.2537,["l"]=5,["m"]=1429,["t"]="Bounty on Garrick Padfoot",["g"]="Deputy Willem",["o"]="kill garrick padfoot and bring his head to deputy willem at northshire abbey. garrick padfoot - a cutthroat who's plagued our farmers and merchants for weeks - was seen at a shack near the vineyards, which lies east of the abbey and across the bridge.  bring me the villain's head, and earn his bounty!\n\nbut be wary, vanessa.  garrick has gathered a gang of thugs around him.  he will not be an easy man to reach."},[457]={["y"]=44.3355,["x"]=58.7204,["o"]="conservator ilthalaine needs you to kill 7 mangy nightsabers and 7 thistle boars. thinning the younger population of creatures here in shadowglen was a good start, vanessa, but there is still work to be done.\n\nthe resources of the forest will be depleted too quickly if the problem is not addressed.  killing nature's beasts is a necessary evil for the good of all who share the land.  venture into the forest and slay mangy nightsabers and thistle boars in the name of balance.",["m"]=1438,["l"]=3,["g"]="Conservator Ilthalaine",["t"]="The Balance of Nature"},[3116]={["y"]=44.3366,["x"]=58.709,["o"]="read the simple sigil and speak to alyissia in shadowglen. this sigil was given to me by a messenger from our warrior trainer, alyissia. it seems alyissia would have words with you when you have a moment. read it and bring it to her afterwards.",["m"]=1438,["l"]=1,["g"]="Conservator Ilthalaine",["t"]="Simple Sigil"},[97977]={["y"]=45.1917,["x"]=57.7621,["o"]="collect 4 gnarlpine totems and bring them to tarindrella. the gnarlpine furbolg would not turn on their ancient allies so readily. we must learn more of their plight.\n\nsearch their abandoned homes for totems. if any survived the chaos of their departure, their engravings may tell us more of what happened here.\n\nyou'll find their camps along the western edge of the glen, though the grell and grellkin may have scattered them beyond.",["m"]=1438,["l"]=3,["g"]="Tarindrella",["t"]="Nature's Call"},[459]={["y"]=45.1917,["x"]=57.7621,["t"]="The Woodland Protector",["m"]=1438,["l"]=3,["g"]="Tarindrella",["o"]="collect 8 fel moss and bring them to tarindrella. something evil is brewing in the forests of teldrassil.  look long the hills to where the peaceful furbolgs used to dwell.  they have deserted their homes and are amassing under the name of the gnarlpine tribe.\n\nonly the corruption of wicked fel moss could cause such a transformation.  the grells and grellkin have infested the area and are threatening the residents of shadowglen.  \n\nengage these grells and grellkin, vanessa, and see if they are indeed caught under the enchantment of the wicked fel moss."},[21]={["y"]=41.6409,["x"]=48.8677,["g"]="Marshal McBride",["m"]=1429,["l"]=5,["o"]="kill 12 kobold laborers, then return to marshal mcbride at northshire abbey. your previous investigations are proof that the echo ridge mine needs purging.  return to the mine and help clear it of kobolds.\n\nwaste no time, vanessa.  the longer the kobolds are left unmolested in the mine, the deeper a foothold they gain in northshire.",["t"]="Skirmish at Echo Ridge"},[99127]={["y"]=62.2418,["x"]=47.3817,["l"]=7,["m"]=1429,["t"]="A Net Disaster",["o"]="check the fishing traps in crystal lake. the fish just ain't biting today, and there's something wrong going on with them. it's not just empty hooks. i haven't seen a single minnow up in the water at all.\n\nlee here set up some traps overnight. go check to see if we've at least got some stock there. if you find anything weird, make sure to show me.",["g"]="Jason Mathers"},[54]={["y"]=41.623,["x"]=48.9081,["g"]="Marshal McBride",["m"]=1429,["t"]="Report to Goldshire",["o"]="take marshal mcbride's documents to marshal dughan in goldshire. vanessa, you are a warlock with proven interest in the security of northshire.  you are now tasked with the protection of the surrounding elwynn forest.\n\nif you accept this duty, then i have prepared papers that must be delivered to marshal dughan in goldshire.  goldshire lies along the southern road, past the border gates.",["l"]=5},[3903]={["y"]=42.9146,["x"]=48.2537,["l"]=4,["m"]=1429,["t"]="Milly Osworth",["g"]="Deputy Willem",["o"]="kill garrick padfoot and bring his head to deputy willem at northshire abbey. garrick padfoot - a cutthroat who's plagued our farmers and merchants for weeks - was seen at a shack near the vineyards, which lies east of the abbey and across the bridge.  bring me the villain's head, and earn his bounty!\n\nbut be wary, vanessa.  garrick has gathered a gang of thugs around him.  he will not be an easy man to reach."},[4495]={["y"]=41.9629,["x"]=60.8416,["t"]="A Good Friend",["m"]=1438,["l"]=4,["g"]="Dirania Silvershine",["o"]="find iverron by the cave to the north. a friend of mine named iverron usually visits me at the same time every day. the strange thing is that he hasn't been by today at all -- he's several hours late, in fact.\n\ni admit, i am a little worried, vanessa. iverron spends a lot of time over by the cave to the north, and i'm sure you know how dangerous it is there -- spiders, everywhere!\n\nif you happen to be going that way, though, will you keep an eye out for him?"},[106]={["y"]=89.5842,["x"]=43.0912,["g"]="Maybell Maclure",["m"]=1429,["t"]="Young Lovers",["o"]="give maybell's love letter to tommy joe stonefield. oh, i'm cursed!  my heart belongs to tommy joe stonefield, but our families are bitter enemies.  so i can't see him, even though my eyes ache to gaze upon that handsome face!\n\nplease, take this letter and give it to tommy joe.  he's usually at the river to the west of the stonefield farm, which is due west of here.",["l"]=6},[91732]={["y"]=63.9075,["x"]=82.4625,["o"]="collect 4 mining tools from jasperlode mine, then return to hagar lowe in eastvale logging camp. good steel is in short supply after the war, and our tools have suffered for it. the jasperlode miners used finely-crafted picks, and i imagine some of them are still there in the depths of the mine. could you retrieve some for me, and i'll see if i can repurpose the steel?",["m"]=1429,["l"]=7,["g"]="Hagar Lowe",["t"]="Good Steel"},[91740]={["y"]=84.8736,["x"]=78.4137,["l"]=11,["m"]=1429,["t"]="Croaky's Head",["o"]="deliver croaky's head to merell ross at ridgepoint tower. this murloc has no doubt been terrorizing the local roads for some time. you suspect the nearby watch guards will want to know of its demise.",["g"]="Croaky's Head"},[107]={["y"]=83.9401,["x"]=34.9576,["o"]="take gramma stonefield's note to william pestle. i bet william pestle has a potion to unite our two young lovers!\n\nhere, take this note to william.  he's staying at the lion's pride inn in goldshire.",["m"]=1429,["l"]=6,["g"]="Gramma Stonefield",["t"]="Note to William"},[97979]={["y"]=40.5,["x"]=59.1948,["o"]="cast elune's light and shadowmeld. you are born kaldorei--the children of the stars--and have inherited a birthright unlike any other in this world. elune's grace may illuminate our strengths, helping our strikes hit true, or it may help conceal us just as the moon may eclipse the sun.\n\nour long vigil after the defense of mount hyjal has ended, and we have joined an alliance of others--which you will meet in due time. for now, you are nestled in the boughs of teldrassil.\n\ndemonstrate mother moon's gifts, and bask in her blessings.",["m"]=1438,["l"]=1,["g"]="Shanda",["t"]="The Goddess Provides"},[99130]={["y"]=67.149,["x"]=42.125,["g"]="Remy \"Two Times\"",["m"]=1429,["t"]="An Enticing Offer",["o"]="collect 6 vials of animal blood and 18 duskweed petals for murloc bait, then return to remy \"two times\" in goldshire. i've got a few ideas on how to deal with murlocs. and one of those also helps some others in the process.\n\nthere's a weed often found on farms in the area called duskweed, and in large quantities the petals are toxic to most animals. if we make some murloc bait with the plant, hopefully that can train those creatures to stay away.\n\nand some farmers get their fields cleared in the process. truly a win-win... truly a win-win.",["l"]=7},[7]={["y"]=41.6549,["x"]=48.876,["t"]="Kobold Camp Cleanup",["m"]=1429,["l"]=2,["g"]="Marshal McBride",["o"]="kill 10 kobold vermin, then return to marshal mcbride. your first task is one of cleansing, vanessa.  a clan of kobolds have infested the woods to the north.  go there and fight the kobold vermin you find.  reduce their numbers so that we may one day drive them from northshire."},[111]={["y"]=85.953,["x"]=29.9209,["o"]="speak with gramma stonefield. please, reirin, talk with my gramma.  if anyone can find a way to bring me together with maybell, she can.\n\nshe's inside our house east of here.",["m"]=1429,["l"]=6,["g"]="Tommy Joe Stonefield",["t"]="Speak with Gramma"},[112]={["y"]=65.8512,["x"]=43.3108,["l"]=7,["m"]=1429,["t"]="Collecting Kelp",["g"]="William Pestle",["o"]="bring 4 crystal kelp fronds to william pestle in goldshire. i can make an invisibility liquor for maybell, so she can slip away from the maclure vineyards and go to tommy joe.  but to make the liquor, i need some crystal kelp.\n\nalthough the kelp usually grows in the ocean... sometimes murlocs collect it.  see if the murlocs near crystal lake have any.  crystal lake is just east of goldshire."},[5545]={["y"]=66.2556,["x"]=81.2991,["o"]="bring 8 bundles of wood to raelen at the eastvale logging camp. i've got a real problem on my hands. i have a deadline looming for an order of lumber, and i'm running out of time. the wolves and bears north of here have chased my workers away from the bundles of wood that they've already chopped.\n\ni've already talked to deputy rainer about clearing the animals, but i need someone to go collect the wood for me. if you could collect eight bundles of wood for me i might just make my deadline.",["m"]=1429,["l"]=9,["g"]="Supervisor Raelen",["t"]="A Bundle of Trouble"},[114]={["y"]=65.8948,["x"]=43.3277,["l"]=7,["m"]=1429,["t"]="The Escape",["g"]="William Pestle",["o"]="take the invisibility liquor to maybell maclure. take this invisibility liquor to young maybell.  it should last long enough for her to visit tommy joe."},[456]={["y"]=44.3534,["x"]=58.7098,["o"]="kill 7 young nightsabers and 4 young thistle boars and return to conservator ilthalaine. greetings, vanessa.  i am conservator ilthalaine.  my purpose in shadowglen is to ensure that the balance of nature is maintained.\n\nthe spring rains were particularly heavy this year, causing some of the forest's beasts to flourish while others suffered.\n\nunfortunately, the nightsaber and thistle boar populations grew too large.  shadowglen can only produce so much food for the beasts.  journey forth, young warlock, and thin the boar and saber populations so that nature's harmony will be preserved.",["m"]=1438,["l"]=2,["g"]="Conservator Ilthalaine",["t"]="The Balance of Nature"},[916]={["y"]=41.7047,["x"]=57.8267,["t"]="Webwood Venom",["m"]=1438,["l"]=4,["g"]="Gilshalan Windwalker",["o"]="bring 10 webwood venom sacs to gilshalan windwalker at aldrassil. i came to shadowglen to observe the webwood spiders that dwell in the shadowthread cave.  they are cousin to a much smaller variety of spider; i believe the world tree has had a profound effect on them, and i would like specimens to study to confirm this.\n\nfirst, i would like some of their venom.  gather webwood venom sacs from the spiders in and around the shadowthread cave, to the north.  i can then examine them for similarities with their smaller cousin's venom."},[3905]={["y"]=39.4338,["x"]=50.7477,["l"]=4,["m"]=1429,["t"]="Grape Manifest",["o"]="bring the grape manifest to brother neals in northshire abbey. now that my crop is saved, take this grape manifest to brother neals.  he manages the store of food and drink in northshire, and i'm sure he'll be delighted to hear that he has fresh grapes.\n\nyou'll find brother neals in the abbey, in the bell tower... where he likes to taste his wine.",["g"]="Milly Osworth"},[18]={["y"]=42.8263,["x"]=48.1294,["g"]="Deputy Willem",["m"]=1429,["l"]=4,["o"]="bring 12 red burlap bandanas to deputy willem outside the northshire abbey. recently, a new group of thieves has been hanging around northshire.  they call themselves the defias brotherhood, and have been seen across the river to the east.\n\ni don't know what they're up to, but i'm sure it's not good!  bring me the bandanas they wear, and i'll reward you with a weapon.",["t"]="Brotherhood of Thieves"},[91743]={["y"]=40.4713,["x"]=49.5893,["l"]=2,["m"]=1429,["t"]="Rascally Rodents",["g"]="Brother Paxton",["o"]="retrieve 8 stolen books from kobolds in northshire valley and return them to brother paxton. those awful kobolds are eating my books! you have to get them back before they devour my whole library."},[2998]={["y"]=66.1087,["x"]=41.1483,["t"]="Tome of Divinity",["m"]=1429,["l"]=12,["o"]="speak to duthorian rall in stormwind. greetings, sister. duthorian rall, one of our most influential paladins, was speaking about you recently. i overheard him talking about how it was time you be put to the test some... along with some very complimentary things about how well you've performed thus far.\n\nif i were you, i'd head to stormwind and speak to him when you have time. i'm sure he's in the cathedral of light--that's where he spends most of his time.",["g"]="Brother Wilhelm"},[52]={["y"]=72.1401,["x"]=73.8884,["o"]="kill 8 prowlers and 5 young forest bears, and then return to guard thomas at the east elwynn bridge. hail, vydelin.  wild animals are growing more and more aggressive the farther we get from goldshire, and the eastvale logging camp suffers nearly constant attacks from wolves and bears!\n\nwe could use your help out here.",["m"]=1429,["l"]=10,["g"]="Guard Thomas",["t"]="Protect the Frontier"},[488]={["y"]=56.3279,["x"]=60.4876,["o"]="bring zenn foulhoof outside of dolanaar 3 nightsaber fangs, 3 strigid owl feathers and 3 swatches of webwood spider silk. eager for work, i see.  lucky for you a day never goes by that i don't wish i had a fledgling warlock to perform my bidding.\n\nyou see, vanessa, i can make you very happy and provide you with things you never dreamed of having.  but in order for that to happen you must bring me certain items.\n\nmy business in the forest often requires certain. . .reagents.  fetch for me 3 nightsaber fangs, 3 strigid owl feathers and 3 swatches of webwood spider silk.\n\nlet's keep this our little secret, human.",["m"]=1438,["l"]=5,["g"]="Zenn Foulhoof",["t"]="Zenn's Bidding"},[917]={["y"]=41.5896,["x"]=57.8104,["t"]="Webwood Egg",["m"]=1438,["l"]=5,["g"]="Gilshalan Windwalker",["o"]="bring a webwood egg to gilshalan in aldrassil. now that i have the spiders' venom, i'd like some live specimens to study.  unfortunately, capturing a living, giant spider is more than i can ask of you, young warlock.  and a giant spider is more than i could handle myself!\n\nbut if you can find an unhatched egg, then delivering specimens will be much easier, and i can then arrange for the unhatched spiders to be contained.\n\nthere must be a nest deep in the shadowthread cave.  please, search for an egg in the nest and return it to me."},[3519]={["y"]=32.9728,["x"]=54.6305,["t"]="A Friend in Need",["m"]=1438,["l"]=4,["g"]="Iverron",["o"]="speak to dirania silvershine in shadowglen. ughhh... i was bitten very badly by a spider named githyiss the vile while exploring the spider cave very close to here. i am sure i have been seriously poisoned; you must help me.\n\nplease tell dirania silvershine. she will be able to help me.\n\nhurry... i'm so dizzy..."},[96606]={["y"]=56.7098,["x"]=57.5432,["o"]="sit near lyreena's basic campfire and wait until you receive the boosted rest buff. greetings, warrior. i can see you've got the look of an adventurer about you. this is good. the world needs more of us restless souls, seeking fortune and glory.\n\nyou'll need to learn to thrive in the wilds to be successful in this line of work. not sure how your outdoor skills are but i can probably teach you a thing or two, if you'd be apt to learn.\n\nhave a seat near the fire and get comfortable. i'll walk you through it.",["m"]=1438,["l"]=6,["g"]="Lyreena Duskblade",["t"]="The Great Outdoors"},[4161]={["y"]=61.311,["x"]=57.0626,["o"]="collect 7 small spider legs for zarrin in dolanaar. long ago, the night elves were called the kaldorei, a name that means \"children of the stars.\" learning of the past is an important step in your path as a warlock, vanessa, so listen well to what i have to tell you.\n\nthe kaldorei have always taken much pride in their harmonious relationship with nature. this means that we only take from nature what is necessary, and that we return in kind. this balance has afforded us much, vanessa.\n\ngo out and collect seven small spider legs -- no more than that, and return to me.",["m"]=1438,["l"]=7,["g"]="Zarrin",["t"]="Recipe of the Kaldorei"},[490]={["y"]=53.3152,["x"]=38.9356,["o"]="shayla nightbreeze on the road outside of darnassus wants you to bring her 15 gnarlpine fangs. by strict orders from the sentinels, i am commissioning a bounty on the gnarlpine. they are no longer friends of the forest. their corruption has left them mindless threats to our people and the creatures of the glade.\n\nas decreed, you shall be rewarded for removing the furbolg menaces from teldrassil. bring to me their fangs as proof of your deeds.\n\nyou will find furbolg concentrated in ban'ethil hollow, west of dolanaar and south of the road, and in starbreeze village to the east.",["m"]=1438,["l"]=8,["g"]="Sentinel Shayla Nightbreeze",["t"]="Bounty: Gnarlpine Furbolg"},[99046]={["y"]=59.4526,["x"]=55.988,["o"]="search for sentinel eralya leafshadow on the road leading to the oracle glade. the council of the forest sent a small group of sentinels to the oracle tree some time ago. the tree sends messages to our elders, and it falls to us to deliver them to darnassus safely.\n\ni received word that our most recent runner has not yet arrived. the oracle's messages vary in frequency, but it has been abnormally long.\n\nplease head towards the oracle glade along the road to the west and check on her. it would have been eralya leafshadow's turn, and she is still in training. elune guide you.",["m"]=1438,["l"]=9,["g"]="Sentinel Kyra Starsong",["t"]="The Lost Runner"},[929]={["y"]=61.6824,["x"]=56.1636,["o"]="fill the jade phial and bring it back to corithras moonrage in dolanaar. first, let me tell you more of the task you must complete. the druids in darnassus use the water of the moonwells of teldrassil, and their moonwell must be replenished from time to time. using these specially crafted phials, you can collect the water of the moonwells.\n\ntake this vessel to the moonwell outside of starbreeze village to the east, and fill it with some of its waters, then return to me. when you have completed your task, i shall continue the story where tenaron left off...",["m"]=1438,["l"]=5,["g"]="Corithras Moonrage",["t"]="Crown of the Earth"},[2159]={["y"]=47.5895,["x"]=61.1816,["o"]="bring the dolanaar delivery to innkeeper keldamyr. greetings, young warlock.  can you offer me aid?  i have a package of herbs that i must deliver to the town of dolanaar.  but i still have business with the druids of shadowglen and cannot yet leave.\n\ncan you deliver this package for me?  it must be sent to innkeeper keldamyr, at the dolanaar inn.  it lies along the road, to the south.",["m"]=1438,["l"]=5,["g"]="Porthannius",["t"]="Dolanaar Delivery"},[96630]={["y"]=39.4841,["x"]=59.0887,["t"]="The Adventurer",["m"]=1438,["l"]=6,["g"]="Lost Journal",["o"]="bring the journal to lyreena duskblade near dolanaar. <the journal appears to be quite plain, detailing the life and adventures of someone you've never heard of.\n\nthere are multiple entries mentioning camping. it seems to be quite... fun.>"},[928]={["y"]=39.3868,["x"]=59.0913,["t"]="Crown of the Earth",["m"]=1438,["l"]=5,["g"]="Tenaron Stormgrip",["o"]="bring the partially filled vessel to corithras moonrage in dolanaar. while there is more i could speak to you of the moonwells and of teldrassil, i must send you along. corithras moonrage will be expecting you. i have poured the phial of water you brought to me into this vessel to bring to him.\n\nseek out corithras. you will find him at the moonwell in dolanaar. follow the road south from aldrassil out of shadowglen, and continue to follow the cobblestones as the road turns west.\n\nmind you stay on the road though, vanessa. there are dangerous beasts in the forests of late."},[921]={["y"]=39.3924,["x"]=59.0872,["t"]="Crown of the Earth",["m"]=1438,["l"]=5,["g"]="Tenaron Stormgrip",["o"]="fill the crystal phial and bring it back to tenaron stormgrip atop aldrassil. it is time for you to set out to seek your destiny, vanessa. but before you are ready to set out into the world beyond our enchanted forests, there is much you must learn about our recent history.\n\nmuch has changed with our people since the battle of mount hyjal. nordrassil lies a pale shadow of what it once was, its power used to defeat archimonde and drive back the burning legion...\n\nthere is a task you must perform. go to the moonwell north of aldrassil and return me a phial of its water."},[3522]={["y"]=41.9794,["x"]=60.8379,["t"]="Iverron's Antidote",["m"]=1438,["l"]=4,["g"]="Dirania Silvershine",["o"]="bring iverron's antidote to iverron before the time limit is up. iverron can be found by the cave to the north. the antidote is ready, vanessa. please see that iverron drinks it.\n\nthere is something that you should know -- the antidote -- it will only remain viable for 5 minutes. you must get it to him in time.\n\nspeed be with you, vanessa."},[920]={["y"]=41.5764,["x"]=57.7923,["t"]="Tenaron's Summons",["m"]=1438,["l"]=5,["g"]="Gilshalan Windwalker",["o"]="speak with tenaron stormgrip atop aldrassil in shadowglen. vanessa, is it? i heard that tenaron has been asking for you. you'll find him in the highest room atop aldrassil.\n\nwe may live long lives, but it's best you not keep him waiting too long."},[3521]={["y"]=41.9668,["x"]=60.8438,["t"]="Iverron's Antidote",["m"]=1438,["l"]=4,["g"]="Dirania Silvershine",["o"]="collect 7 hyacinth mushrooms, 4 moonpetal lilies, and 1 webwood ichor for dirania silveshine in shadowglen. we may be able to help iverron, as i know of an antidote that should help with the poison. it requires some ingredients, though, before i can make it.\n\ni'll need hyacinth mushrooms. you can find these growing under trees, or you may collect them from the grell south of here; they seem to have taken a liking to them. i'll also need moonpetal lilies, which only grow around watery pools.\n\nthe last ingredient may prove the most difficult. from the very spiders that poisoned iverron, collect webwood ichor."},[97236]={["y"]=25.7954,["x"]=56.874,["o"]="deliver the fang of githyiss to someone interested in the study of spiders in aldrassil. a fresh specimen from a beast of this size is quite a find. perhaps someone in aldrassil familiar with the study of spiders would be interested in the fang.",["m"]=1438,["l"]=5,["g"]="Fang of Githyiss",["t"]="Fang of Githyiss"},[487]={["y"]=58.4464,["x"]=55.1503,["o"]="slay 6 gnarlpine ambushers and return to sentinel amara nightwalker outside of dolanaar. the road to darnassus must be kept safe.  travelers heading from dolanaar to darnassus have been reporting ruthless attacks by corrupted furbolgs from the gnarlpine tribe.\n\nimportant news and commerce travels to and from darnassus by way of this road daily.  we cannot afford to have a rogue band of heathens terrorizing people.\n\ntake up arms in the name of the sacred forest, warlock.  their den lies somewhere below this vantage point.  slay 6 of these gnarlpine ambushers and report back to me.",["m"]=1438,["l"]=8,["g"]="Moon Priestess Amara",["t"]="The Road to Darnassus"},[997]={["y"]=57.6909,["x"]=56.1395,["t"]="Denalan's Earth",["m"]=1438,["l"]=5,["g"]="Syral Bladeleaf",["o"]="bring the package of rare earth to denalan at lake al'ameth. are you heading to the south?  to lake al'ameth?  if so, then i have a task i might ask of you...\n\nmy colleague denalan has a camp along the eastern end of the lake, where he is studying and experimenting on the plant life of teldrassil.  he requested a package of rare earths from darnassus and it was late, only recently arriving here in dolanaar.\n\ncan you take the package to him?"},[97950]={["y"]=56.6392,["x"]=57.6141,["o"]="speak with trianna in darnassus to learn to craft a camping item for your profession once you have shown proficiency in your skill. tailoring is a surprisingly potent tradeskill to invest in, and i'm sure it'll serve you well.\n\ni know someone that can teach you how to craft a faction banner for your camp, provided you have the skill for it. inspiration and morale are a key part of success on any battlefield, and an inspirational banner can go a long way to keeping you energized.",["m"]=1438,["l"]=6,["g"]="Lyreena Duskblade",["t"]="Camping 101: Tailoring"},[2438]={["y"]=56.9339,["x"]=55.5287,["o"]="bring the emerald dreamcatcher to tallonkai swiftroot in dolanaar. i was once given an emerald dreamcatcher from gaerolas talvethen, the warden of the druids in the ban'ethil barrow den. this powerful amulet is able to siphon energy from the emerald dream, bestowing luck upon those who carry it.\n\nsadly, i have not been able to retrieve it from my dresser in starbreeze village... although starbreeze was once a tranquil place, it has now succumbed to the corruption of the furbolg that reside there.\n\nperhaps you would be willing to recover my dreamcatcher, warlock? ",["m"]=1438,["l"]=6,["g"]="Tallonkai Swiftroot",["t"]="The Emerald Dreamcatcher"},[87288]={["y"]=57.1102,["x"]=55.5585,["o"]="bring 6 soft nightsaber pelts to aldria. hello, traveler! i hope you are enjoying your visit to our village. i like dolanaar because it is small and rustic and everyone is friendly.\n\ni'm a local trader, and i bring in all sorts of tools and trinkets that might be useful to you in your travels. indeed, if you are interested in a trade, i find myself in need of some nightsaber pelts. while these majestic creatures are beautiful, the local ones are rather aggressive, so don't feel too bad about defending yourself.",["m"]=1438,["l"]=7,["g"]="Aldia",["t"]="Soft Saber Pelts"},[475]={["y"]=57.3179,["x"]=55.9462,["t"]="A Troubling Breeze",["m"]=1438,["l"]=6,["g"]="Athridas Bearmantle",["o"]="seek out gaerolas talvethren in starbreeze village.\n a troubling breeze blows through the forest.\n\ngaerolas talvethren serves as great warden to the hibernating druids of the talon in the ban'ethil barrow den.  his duty as the chosen protector of the sleeping is to ensure their safety so that their pact with ysera remains fulfilled.\n\nbut word from gaerolas is now delayed and i grow nervous.  travel east to starbreeze village and bring back a report from gaerolas so that i can put my worries to rest, knowing my dreaming brethren slumber safely."},[97948]={["y"]=56.7022,["x"]=57.5441,["o"]="speak with kurdram stonehammer in auberdine to learn to craft a camping item for your profession once you have shown proficiency in your skill. mining isn't the most glamorous, but it's good honest work and a fine profession for you to explore.\n\ni reckon i know someone that can teach you how to craft a lodestone for your camp. build one of these and everyone who wants to swing a sword will be eager to gather round your fire and soak up the extra \"oomph\" it can provide to increase their combat prowess.",["m"]=1438,["l"]=6,["g"]="Lyreena Duskblade",["t"]="Camping 101: Mining"},[96634]={["y"]=56.6392,["x"]=57.6141,["o"]="speak with zarrin in dolanaar to learn to become a cook. so you want to learn more about camping, huh? good for you, warrior. the first step any adventurer needs to take is to become a cook and learn how to make a campfire.\n\ncooking's not just about making tasty foods. it's also the foundation for your camp.",["m"]=1438,["l"]=6,["g"]="Lyreena Duskblade",["t"]="Camping 101: Cooking"},[98391]={["y"]=56.8344,["x"]=55.5792,["o"]="speak to sister aquinne in darnassus. blessings to you, warlock. the sisterhood of elune has stood as a pillar of kaldorei society for thousands of years.\n\nbefore the great sundering, before the war of the ancients, through the long vigil, we have guided and healed our people through the darkness. such is our charge, and such is the demand of the peerless mother moon.\n\nwe now require your aid in a matter of great importance. sister aquinne awaits your arrival in darnassus.",["m"]=1438,["l"]=10,["g"]="Laurna Morninglight",["t"]="The Sisterhood of Elune"},[932]={["y"]=56.9339,["x"]=55.5287,["o"]="kill lord melenas and bring his head to tallonkai swiftroot in dolanaar. i must warn you, vanessa, this matter must stay between us. the satyr are enough of an embarrassment to us already, and this one is much too close to home.\n\nhe is called lord melenas. he resides in the nearby cave of fel rock where he has gathered a large group of grell warriors. his heart is black as night, and he plots something most foul.\n\nyou must find him within his nearby cave just to the north of here, and bring me his head.",["m"]=1438,["l"]=8,["g"]="Tallonkai Swiftroot",["t"]="Twisted Hatred"},[99050]={["y"]=56.7802,["x"]=55.3377,["o"]="collect 6 dewy lasher fronds, an empty vial, and a refreshing spring water for byancie in dolanaar. i will need your help acquiring the ingredients i need to stop the affliction long enough for eralya to make it back here for further treatment.\n\nthankfully, our living home is still bountiful and will provide in our time of need.\n\nthe core ingredient is dewy lasher fronds. you'll find them around lake al'ameth directly south of here, or wellspring lake and its river to the northwest.\n\nin addition, i'll need an empty vial and some spring water. both can be bought here in town, or traded for.",["m"]=1438,["l"]=10,["g"]="Byancie",["t"]="The Great Tree Provides"},[5921]={["y"]=8.1675,["x"]=35.3124,["t"]="Moonglade",["m"]=1457,["l"]=10,["g"]="Mathrengyl Bearwalker",["o"]="use the spell \"teleport: moonglade\" to travel to moonglade.  when you arrive, speak with dendrite starblaze in the village of nighthaven. all druids are welcome in the sacred lands of moonglade, regardless of the current tensions in the cenarion circle between arch druid staghelm and keeper remulos - moonglade's guardian.  now that you're learning the ways of the claw, i'll teach you the spell that lets you transport yourself there.  cast it whenever you seek moonglade's knowledge or solace.\n\nas for your first lesson, travel to moonglade and speak with dendrite starblaze in nighthaven about the path you're now on.  good luck, young druid."},[486]={["y"]=57.3122,["x"]=55.9599,["t"]="Ursal the Mauler",["m"]=1438,["l"]=12,["g"]="Athridas Bearmantle",["o"]="kill ursal the mauler and return to athridas bearmantle in dolanaar. now the time has come to save the druids of the talon. if we fail now, sylvie, they will be forever lost in sleep.\n\ni shall prepare the relics of wakening and perform the ritual. for my work to take effect, the cursed beast responsible for this horrible situation must be slain. only then will the ritual be complete.\n\nit was ursal the mauler who meddled with our brethren's calling and it is ursal the mauler who must now pay so they can be freed. travel to gnarlpine hold in the southwest and slay him."},[5931]={["y"]=30.4813,["x"]=56.2572,["t"]="Back to Darnassus",["m"]=1450,["l"]=10,["g"]="Dendrite Starblaze",["o"]="return to darnassus and speak with mathrengyl bearwalker in the cenarion enclave. the time has come for us to part ways, young one, as the application of your lessons takes you back to whom that sent you to me.  mathrengyl bearwalker walks truly in balance with nature, even as he dwells precariously close to where the balance has faltered.  listen to his instructions, and you will soon complete your first lessons into your role as a protector of balance.\n\ngo now, young one.  we shall meet again."},[99053]={["y"]=58.972,["x"]=44.6657,["t"]="Escaping Ban'ethil",["m"]=1438,["l"]=10,["g"]="Sentinel Lynessa Duskblossom",["o"]="help sentinel lynessa duskblossom escape ban'ethil barrow den, and report her safety to sentinel kyra starsong in dolanaar. my prayers have been answered! i am thankful that you have fought your way down here.\n\ni was sent here by the oracle tree to deliver a message to the slumbering druids here only to find it completely overrun by furbolg! they ambushed me before i could turn back and brought me down here--i fear for their next meal.\n\ni don't know about you, but i loathe this place. under the earth is no place for the kaldorei."},[98067]={["y"]=89.7941,["x"]=39.8948,["o"]="place sentinel owls at the entrance to the cenarion hold depths, the darnassus bank, the craftsman's terrace inn, and the city gate for sentinel dalia sunblade in the temple of the moon in darnassus. general feathermoon ensures all sentinels have time to pray to elune. a proper huntress wields not blade alone, but gifts of the goddess to overcome our enemies.\n\nyou may help with my daily duties. place sentinels around the city--start with the tunnels leading beneath cenarion hold to the north, the bank at the center of town, the inn in the craftsman's terrace to the northeast, and the city gates. the guards can assist you.\n\nsomething is amiss in teldrassil--we must remain vigilant.",["m"]=1457,["l"]=11,["g"]="Sentinel Dalia Sunblade",["t"]="Eyes of the Sentinels"},[6001]={["y"]=8.1148,["x"]=35.2251,["t"]="Body and Heart",["m"]=1457,["l"]=10,["g"]="Mathrengyl Bearwalker",["o"]="use the cenarion moondust on the moonkin stone of auberdine to bring forth lunaclaw.  from there, you must face lunaclaw and earn the strength of body and heart it possesses.\n\nspeak with mathrengyl bearwalker in darnassus when you are done. directly east of auberdine lay many moonkin caves.  the one closest to auberdine has a moonkin stone inside it.  lunaclaw, the defender of the stone, will face you only when cenarion moondust is applied to it.  lunaclaw possesses within it a strength that you must use as one of the claw.\n\nyou've earned the right to use this cenarion moondust, sylvie... now show me that you've earned the right to possess the strength of body and the strength of heart neede"},[918]={["y"]=68.4075,["x"]=60.859,["o"]="bring 8 timberling seeds to denelan at lake al'ameth. the timberlings of teldrassil are elementals of nature.  in some ways they reflect the natural order of plants and animals on our great tree.\n\nso it is disturbing to see how angry the timberlings have become.\n\ni believe it has something to do with the soil.  i have been working on different methods of nurturing plants and would like to try them on timberling seeds.  please, can you gather seeds from timberlings around lake al'ameth and bring them to me?",["m"]=1438,["l"]=7,["g"]="Denalan",["t"]="Timberling Seeds"},[919]={["y"]=68.4075,["x"]=60.859,["o"]="bring 12 timberling sprouts to denalan at lake al'ameth. small timberlings are sprouting around the waters of lake al'ameth.  i'm afraid these sprouts are beyond help -- we should try to clear them from the land before they grow large enough to cause trouble.\n\nwhen you're wandering the lake, if you see any timberling sprouts please take them.  help keep our land clean!",["m"]=1438,["l"]=7,["g"]="Denalan",["t"]="Timberling Sprouts"},[2518]={["y"]=85.9696,["x"]=36.4959,["o"]="priestess a'moora in the temple of the moon at darnassus wants you to bring her lady sathrah's silvery spinnerets. lady sathrah was once beloved of elune. graceful and pure, the spider spun her silver threads through the moonlight, catching the evening mist. the silvery dew had strong healing powers and was kept here in the temple.\n\nbut of late, sathrah has descended into madness. her future generations are now threatened as well.\n\nfind lady sathrah, sylvie, and end her suffering. she dwells along the northern borders of teldrassil, near wellspring lake. gather her silvery spinnerets and bring them back to me.",["m"]=1457,["l"]=12,["g"]="Priestess A'moora",["t"]="Tears of the Moon"},[2519]={["y"]=45.2997,["x"]=29.1449,["t"]="The Temple of the Moon",["m"]=1457,["l"]=10,["g"]="Sister Aquinne",["o"]="sister aquinne wants you to speak with priestess a'moora in the temple of the moon. a once great creature of the forest is in need of help, night elf.\n\nthere is a difficult task that must be done.\n\nplease seek out priestess a'moora; she will explain things to you. find her to the southeast of here, inside the temple of the moon."},[922]={["y"]=68.4037,["x"]=60.911,["t"]="Rellian Greenspyre",["m"]=1438,["l"]=7,["g"]="Denalan",["o"]="bring a timberling seed to rellian greenspyre in darnassus. vanessa, can you take one of the seeds you brought me to my friend, rellian greenspyre?  he is a druid in darnassus, and when last we spoke he revealed his interest in my work with the timberlings.  he had some ideas himself, and he will appreciate a specimen seed to work with.\n\nthank you, vanessa.  you have been a great help to me.  i hope that, some day, you will see the fruit of my labors.\n\nyou will usually find rellian walking the pathways of the cenarion enclave in darnassus."},[923]={["y"]=21.6039,["x"]=38.4483,["o"]="bring 5 mossy tumors to rellian greenspyre in darnassus. there is a malevolence growing in the timberlings.  we are trying to find the source, but until we do...in order to keep teldrassil safe we must cut down the timberlings who are beyond help.  those that wander wellspring lake in northern teldrassil are the most tainted.  they must be removed!\n\ndestroy the timberlings you find there, and gather the mossy tumors growing upon them.  bring the tumors to me so that they may be burned.",["m"]=1457,["l"]=9,["g"]="Rellian Greenspyre",["t"]="Tumors"},[6341]={["y"]=92.4083,["x"]=56.2249,["o"]="bring nessa's collection to vesprystus. the fishermen of rut'theran village do very well, for the fish here are extremely large and abundant.  i would like to compare the bounty here with that of the mainland.\n\ni have a collection of fish bones and scales that i would like taken to a colleague of mine in darkshore.  his name is laird, he is a fish vendor in the village of auberdine.\n\nbring my collection to our hippogryph master, vesprystus, and speak to him about traveling to auberdine.",["m"]=1438,["l"]=10,["g"]="Nessa Shadowsong",["t"]="The Bounty of Teldrassil"},[927]={["y"]=36.9836,["x"]=42.8977,["t"]="The Moss-twined Heart",["m"]=1438,["l"]=12,["g"]="Moss-twined Heart",["o"]="bring the moss-twined heart to denalan at lake al'ameth. the heart of blackmoss the fetid is covered with a dark, oily moss.  in fact, the only way to tell this is a heart is from its slow, rhythmic beat... a beat that continues even now.\n\nperhaps denalan will want to see this heart."},[2541]={["y"]=61.505,["x"]=44.9362,["t"]="The Sleeping Druid",["m"]=1438,["l"]=8,["g"]="Oben Rageclaw",["o"]="bring a shaman voodoo charm to oben rageclaw in the ban'ethil barrow den. the gnarlpine shaman that inhabit this place have discovered a way of separating a sleeping druid's spirit from the physical body. the furbolg have animated my physical form and are using it to attack anyone that attempts to explore the ban'ethil barrow den. i am now trapped in the emerald dream, powerless to stop this.\n\nyou must help me. the gnarlpine shaman carry a strange charm which is used to perform this ritual, and i'd like to examine it. please, sylvie, bring one to me."},[935]={["y"]=61.6802,["x"]=56.1565,["o"]="bring the filled vessel to arch druid fandral staghelm in darnassus. without the blessings of alexstrasza the life-binder and nozdormu the timeless, teldrassil's growth has not been without flaw. strange beasts have been reported arising from the very ground of the tree, and crazed furbolgs attack passing travelers.\n\ni can only hope that the solution the arch druid is looking for will be found quickly. i will pour all the phials you brought into this vessel, for you to deliver to darnassus.\n\nbring it to fandral staghelm, you will find him in the druid grove.",["m"]=1438,["l"]=11,["g"]="Corithras Moonrage",["t"]="Crown of the Earth"},[98392]={["y"]=34.4185,["x"]=38.2771,["t"]="Darkness in the Glade",["m"]=1438,["l"]=12,["g"]="Sentinel Arynia Cloudsbreak",["o"]="collect hatescreech's amulet, windmistress gaedress' amulet, and witchmother arysa's amulet for sentinel arynia cloudsbreak in the oracle glade. these belts... look closely at the leather, sylvie. do you see the taint running through the fibers?\n\ni have a suspicion as to its origin, but we will need further proof to be sure.\n\nventure back out into the harpies' nests to the west and take out their leaders. if their necklaces carry the same darkness as these belts, we'll have our answer."},[99047]={["y"]=36.726,["x"]=37.5435,["t"]="Not Dead Yet",["m"]=1438,["l"]=9,["g"]="Sentinel Eralya Leafshadow",["o"]="seek aid from byancie in dolanaar for sentinel eralya leafshadow. my sisters and i... were dispatched... oracle tree...\n\ntree... message. i... harpies... everywhere...\n\n<eralya coughs up blood, grimacing through the pain.>\n\ni may not have long... no one coming. please... byancie... in dolanaar..."},[8372]={["y"]=34.5064,["x"]=58.1236,["o"]="bring 3 warsong gulch marks of honor to an alliance brigadier general outside the battlegrounds. the silverwing sentinels are at war with the warsong outriders due to the destruction the orcs are causing to the forest.  there are, however, more reasons to defend this particular forest than plain love for nature.\n\nthe forest forms a strategic barrier that makes ashenvale defendable against a large-scale attack.  without it, astranaar would last a day or two before being annexed to the barrens.\n\ndo your part in fighting the warsong outriders, sylvie!  for the alliance!",["m"]=1457,["l"]=19,["g"]="Alliance Brigadier General",["t"]="Fight for Warsong Gulch"},[938]={["y"]=31.5658,["x"]=31.5527,["t"]="Mist",["m"]=1438,["l"]=12,["g"]="Mist",["o"]="escort mist to sentinel arynia cloudsbreak at the moon well near the oracle tree. the sabercat's fur is a distinctive gray color, blending into the surrounding forest. as she lays there, you observe that she is badly wounded, with deep lacerations across her back and stomach.\n\nshe raises her head and gazes at you, bright intelligence shining in blue eyes. she seems to wish to follow you."},[937]={["y"]=34.4086,["x"]=38.2925,["t"]="The Enchanted Glade",["m"]=1438,["l"]=11,["g"]="Sentinel Arynia Cloudsbreak",["o"]="acquire 6 bloodfeather belts and bring them to sentinel arynia cloudsbreak in the oracle glade. i was dispatched with a small group of sentinels here to protect the oracle tree from the harpies that have made nests all around the glade. little by little we are trying to push them back.\n\nwhen the oracle tree attempted to send a runner to darnassus with a report, the messenger was attacked and killed by a group of the harpies.\n\nif you feel up to the task, go to their nests, slay them, and return their belts to me as proof of your deeds."},[98403]={["y"]=56.9119,["x"]=55.5172,["o"]="kill 8 befouled webwoods and bring xethorr the wicked's mature fel moss to tallonkai swiftroot in dolanaar. lord melenas did not act alone; he was at the behest of another. the one you seek is xethorr the wicked. it seems he has twisted the spiders that call teldrassil home, intending their venom for some foul plan.\n\nhe has taken residence deep in the forest, in the area to the northwest of here known as the cleft. take caution, and bring allies, for xethorr is not an opponent to be trifled with.\n\ndispatch his brood, and bring me anything that may tell us more of the satyr's work here.",["m"]=1438,["l"]=12,["g"]="Tallonkai Swiftroot",["t"]="Twisted Hatred"},[931]={["y"]=28.8553,["x"]=34.738,["o"]="bring a shimmering frond to denalan at lake al'ameth the fronds on this plant shimmer in the forest light, giving it a twisting, pulsing aura.\n\nyou believe that denalan would want a specimen of this.",["m"]=1438,["l"]=10,["g"]="Strange Fronded Plant",["t"]="The Shimmering Frond"},[2561]={["y"]=61.4922,["x"]=44.9116,["t"]="Druid of the Claw",["m"]=1438,["l"]=10,["g"]="Oben Rageclaw",["o"]="oben rageclaw wants you to kill his soulless body, and then use the voodoo charm. after examining this charm, sylvie, i see now what must be done. please take it, and do as i ask.\n\nyou are to explore the deepest areas of the ban'ethil barrow den. there, you will find my soulless body... although i regret what i am about to tell you, i see no other way to free myself from the control of the gnarlpine.\n\nin order for me to escape them, you must kill my physical form.  once that is done, use the voodoo charm on my fallen body. after you have completed this task, please return to me."},[6342]={["y"]=93.9655,["x"]=58.3371,["t"]="Flight to Auberdine",["m"]=1438,["l"]=10,["g"]="Vesprystus",["o"]="ride a hippogryph to auberdine from the hippogryph master vesprystus, then bring nessa's collection to laird. from rut'theran, there are two methods of travel to auberdine: by ferry and by hippogryph.  both are quick and reliable, but if you have not yet flown to auberdine by hippogryph, then i suggest you do.\n\nit is sound advice to speak with the hippogryph master in every town that has one.  once you speak to the master, you can then fly there from other towns.\n\nhere is nessa's collection.  speak with me again when you are ready to fly to auberdine and deliver nessa's collection to laird."},[97942]={["y"]=56.7084,["x"]=57.5527,["o"]="speak with byancie in dolanaar to learn to craft a camping item for your profession once you have shown proficiency in your skill. so you've taken up first aid? that's an honorable... and pragmatic pursuit as a druid.\n\ni reckon i know someone that can teach you how to craft a first aid kit for your camp. injuries are a reality in the world of adventuring and offering some much-needed healing at your camp could even save lives.",["m"]=1438,["l"]=6,["g"]="Lyreena Duskblade",["t"]="Camping 101: First Aid"},[483]={["y"]=57.3459,["x"]=55.9437,["o"]="retrieve the relics of wakening and bring them to athridas bearmantle in dolanaar. gnarlpine invaders were seen ravaging the ban'ethil barrow den to the west.\n\nthe slumbering druids will be trapped in the emerald dream for eternity, unaware of their fate, unless we help. the delicate hibernation ritual cannot be broken without the relics of wakening.\n\njourney to the den and retrieve the raven claw talisman, black feather quill, sapphire of sky, and rune of nesting. the druids store them in sacred chests.  return them to me and i will prepare the awakening ritual.",["m"]=1438,["l"]=9,["g"]="Athridas Bearmantle",["t"]="The Relics of Wakening"},[5929]={["y"]=30.4157,["x"]=56.2537,["t"]="Great Bear Spirit",["m"]=1450,["l"]=10,["g"]="Dendrite Starblaze",["o"]="seek out the great bear spirit in northwestern moonglade and learn what it has to share with you about the nature of the bear.  when finished, return to dendrite starblaze in nighthaven, moonglade. in the northwest part of moonglade resides the home of a wise and noble being we call the great bear spirit.  for all druids, it has served as a tutor and mentor into the first true natural understanding of the bear.  all druids at one point seek the spirit's wisdom, and you shall be no exception.\n\ngo to the great bear spirit now and learn what it will teach.  when it is satisfied with you, return to me here in nighthaven.  we will then see if you have truly taken account of the lessons it teaches"},[7383]={["y"]=61.6941,["x"]=56.1523,["o"]="fill the amethyst phial and bring it back to corithras moonrage in dolanaar. all was not well with teldrassil, however. staghelm's carefully made plans for the new world tree had borne out as he had hoped, but there was one small problem, a problem to which many of the troubles on teldrassil may be attributed.\n\nhowever, i will not get into that yet. you must visit the last moonwell, to the northwest in the oracle glade. under the boughs of the oracle tree lies the first and most powerful of our wells. retrieve a phial of its water and return to me.",["m"]=1438,["l"]=11,["g"]="Corithras Moonrage",["t"]="Crown of the Earth"},[2459]={["y"]=56.9191,["x"]=55.5144,["t"]="Ferocitas the Dream Eater",["m"]=1438,["l"]=8,["g"]="Tallonkai Swiftroot",["o"]="tallonkai swiftroot in dolanaar wants you to kill 7 gnarlpine mystics and find the missing jewel. the emerald... it is missing! my dreamcatcher has been damaged!\n\nthere is a band of gnarlpine mystics located to the north of starbreeze. i have heard reports that their leader, ferocitas the dream eater has been wearing a necklace that glows green in the night. now seeing my dreamcatcher, i am sure that he has stolen my emerald... he would never realize that its power is useless to him.\n\nfind this missing jewel, vanessa. and, while you're there, clear out some of the corrupted mystics as well."},[489]={["y"]=59.5335,["x"]=56.0561,["t"]="Seek Redemption!",["m"]=1438,["l"]=7,["g"]="Sentinel Kyra Starsong",["o"]="collect 3 fel cones and give them to zenn foulhoof outside of dolanaar. the council of the forest has news that you aided zenn foulhoof. the satyr is an enemy of the forest. as a human, you should know better than to defile the forest by killing nature's creatures.\n\nyou must redeem yourself in the eyes of the council if you wish to remain a friend of teldrassil.\n\nteach foulhoof a lesson and you shall be redeemed. fel cones are corrupted seeds that fall from the trees. they billow with green smoke.\n\ngive some to foulhoof. he'll think you have brought him a harmless snack."},[476]={["y"]=58.5847,["x"]=66.3019,["t"]="Gnarlpine Corruption",["m"]=1438,["l"]=6,["g"]="Gaerolas Talvethren",["o"]="return to athridas bearmantle in dolanaar. the gnarlpine tribe has been corrupted!\n\nthe once peaceful furbolgs have turned against the protectors of the forest.  they ambushed me as i left for the ban'ethil barrow den and proceeded to pillage starbreeze village.  ursal the mauler, their chieftain, is using the evil powers of the fel moss to drive them mad.\n\ni am too wounded to return to athridas to bring him this grave news.  the task is left to you, young warlock.  we can only hope that the deranged gnarlpines have not made it to ban'ethil yet!"},[933]={["y"]=61.7165,["x"]=56.1865,["t"]="Crown of the Earth",["m"]=1438,["l"]=9,["g"]="Corithras Moonrage",["o"]="fill the tourmaline phial and bring it back to corithras moonrage in dolanaar. there is another moonwell southeast of the entrance to darnassus, on the shores of the pools of arlithrien. the sentinels are having problems patrolling the area because of attacks and the growing ill-temperedness of the gnarlpine furbolgs.\n\nbe wary as you seek out the well, and keep your weapons close at hand."},[1688]={["y"]=85.2495,["x"]=39.4023,["o"]="retrieve surena's choker for gakin the darkbinder in stormwind. i had a student named surena caledon. she stood where you stand now, eager to learn of warlock magic, and possessing no small bit of talent. more than that she was young and pleasing to the eye. had i seen it then, the traitorous trollop!\n\nthe thieving wench ran off with one of the defias, erlan drudgemoor. while her loss is of little importance, i gifted her a bloodstone choker that i must have.\n\nher life means nothing to me now. you will find her at the brackwell pumpkin patch. retrieve what is mine.",["m"]=1453,["l"]=10,["g"]="Gakin the Darkbinder",["t"]="Surena Caledon"},[98046]={["y"]=8.7289,["x"]=34.7326,["t"]="Crown of the Earth",["m"]=1457,["l"]=11,["g"]="Arch Druid Fandral Staghelm",["o"]="bring the drained vessel to lariia in the temple of the moon in darnassus. <arch druid fandral staghelm's gaze narrows.>\n\nyou're still here?\n\ntake the phial and get out of my sight, druid. it is clear my answers do not lie in the waters, just as they did not before. \n\nperhaps one of the priestesses in the temple of the moon to the south will dispose of it.\n\n<fandral looks away, no longer speaking to you.>\n\ni must look elsewhere if this is to work..."},[98065]={["y"]=88.2449,["x"]=40.5519,["t"]="Crown of the Earth",["m"]=1457,["l"]=11,["g"]="Lariia",["o"]="bring the moonwell remnants to tyrande whisperwind in the temple of the moon in darnassus. you must bring this to tyrande at once! i will transfer it to a more ceremonial container for you.\n\ndo not be afraid. the high priestess of elune is firm, but kind. she protects all who enter darnassus, and carries our goddess' light to all.\n\nshe will be glad to receive this sacred water. you will find her directly above us."},[2498]={["y"]=21.2867,["x"]=38.4431,["t"]="Return to Denalan",["m"]=1457,["l"]=9,["g"]="Rellian Greenspyre",["o"]="rellian greenspyre wants you to speak with denalan at lake al'ameth. i have just received word that  denalan at lake al'ameth has discovered what may be the cause of the tumors that plague the timberlings. please speak with him, and tell him i sent you.\n\nmake haste, sylvie; he needs our help."},[99073]={["y"]=56.7589,["x"]=55.3648,["o"]="take the lashwater salve to sentinel eralya leafshadow on the road to the oracle tree. the salve is ready. take it to eralya swiftly.\n\ni do not know if it will truly cure her. the rot festers quickly, and grows in strength as it spreads.\n\nit will, if nothing else, ease her suffering. and that is still worth your haste.",["m"]=1438,["l"]=10,["g"]="Byancie",["t"]="Easing Suffering"},[6343]={["y"]=44.3468,["x"]=36.7818,["m"]=1439,["g"]="Laird",["o"]="bring laird's response to nessa shadowsong. i must send a response to nessa.  she'll be very interested to know how different the fish here are from those along teldrassil's coastline.  we can only guess the cause, but it is my suspicion that the world tree itself is affecting the wildlife around it!\n\nplease, take this response to nessa.  if you wish to take a hippogryph back to rut'theran then speak with the hippogryph master caylais moonfeather.  if you wish to take the ferry, then one regularly departs from the dock to the northwest."},[941]={["y"]=68.4144,["x"]=60.9033,["o"]="plant the tainted heart in denalan's planter. i have removed that foul moss from the heart, but it remains tainted...\n\ntry placing the heart in my planter.  it is filled with a nutritive soil that may cleanse and heal the heart.",["m"]=1438,["l"]=12,["g"]="Denalan",["t"]="Planting the Heart"}}) end)()
